OL,3,GNEWSAMan who harassed London MP on Tube
OL,4,Asentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who harassed and intimidated
OL,7,FWalthamstow MP Stella Creasy in a Tube
OL,8,Fcarriage has been given a suspended
OL,9,Fprison sentence.
OL,11,FClifford Wilby, 63, of east London, was
OL,12,Flast month found guilty of harassing
OL,13,Fthe Labour MP on a Victoria line train
OL,14,Fbetween Walthamstow Central and
OL,15,FFinsbury Park on 15 July last year.
OL,17,FWestminster Magistrates' Court heard
OL,18,FWilby spoke to Creasy about knife crime
OL,19,Fand her "failings as a Member of
OL,20,FParliament" before filming her, leading
OL,21,Fto members of the public intervening.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
