OL,3,GNEWSAMan who harassed London MP on Tube
OL,4,Asentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the same court, Wilby was sentenced
OL,7,Fto 12 weeks in prison, suspended for 12
OL,8,Fmonths, and told to complete 10
OL,9,Frehabilitation activity requirement
OL,10,Fdays, and ordered to pay #100.
